        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is investigating an issue with traffic that goes through Cloudflare One Gateway when an identity policy is present in the policy decision. \n\nThis impacts all onramps to Cloudflare One Gateway. \n\nCloudflare One Gateway policies with no identity policy are unaffected.\n\nWe are also seeing impact to the Cloudflare Dashboard and are investigating further.",
